{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "1stact_level_a001_06_beg",
  "groupId": "1stact",
  "stageId": "a001_06",
  "title": "黃金三角",
  "storyCode": "GT-6",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/a001/level_a001_06_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "6fd14363cf1e39b9c33cab0438c67d372400181d1dd8c68627b97f38a06c69a5",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第六关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鮑勃",
      "text": "幾年之前，我們成了感染者。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鮑勃",
      "text": "我們躲躲藏藏，平穩的生活一夜之間就變成了奢侈。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鮑勃",
      "text": "原本，我們以為整合運動能使我們的生活有所改觀，可......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鮑勃",
      "text": "仍舊沒有一家店肯賣給我們麵包，沒有任何地方能容納我們落腳。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鮑勃",
      "text": "所以我和兄弟們離開了那裡，四處流浪，直到聽說了寶藏的消息，來到了這裡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鮑勃",
      "text": "只要這次，只要我們能奪下這份寶藏——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鮑勃",
      "text": "我們就能前往哥倫比亞。雖然那是一片遙遠的土地，但在那裡，感染者還能擁有自己的城鎮和田地。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鮑勃",
      "text": "所以，格拉尼，為了我所有的兄弟，這份寶藏我一定會拿到手。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鮑勃",
      "text": "寶藏不遠了，我知道。你做得很好，但是很遺憾————",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動",
      "text": "女人！你——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "別擋路。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動",
      "text": "嗚啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鮑勃",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "我不管你們是什麼人，要做什麼事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "你們所有人，馬上從我的視線裡消失。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鮑勃",
      "text": "如果一定要和你為敵，斯卡蒂......今天我們會死戰到底。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "所以這種人就是格拉尼你找來的同伴？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "你們拿了寶藏，那滴水村怎麼辦？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鮑勃",
      "text": "不管怎麼樣，他們都還能活下去，我們卻已經無路可走了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鮑勃",
      "text": "雖然我認識你沒多久，但我知道你是什麼樣的人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鮑勃",
      "text": "你跟你身邊那個怪物不一樣，你沒把我們感染者當成外人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "(我覺得斯卡蒂也只是一視同仁地把我們全都幹掉而已，她大概也沒把誰當成外人吧......)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鮑勃",
      "text": "格拉尼，告訴我可蘿爾在哪裡！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鮑勃",
      "text": "你知道這些寶藏對我們意味著什麼！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "抱歉大鮑勃，我已經接下委託了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "我只有一個任務，就是把這份寶藏交給可蘿爾，幫助她讓村子恢復平靜。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "別的與我無關，把可蘿爾交給我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鮑勃",
      "text": "那你要那個女孩幹什麼，怪物？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鮑勃",
      "text": "你難道想要剝掉她的皮，喝掉她的血嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鮑勃",
      "text": "在這之前，你也聽這個小個子說過了，不管怎麼樣，她都不會把村長交給你的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鮑勃",
      "text": "但我不一樣，我只要寶藏。我根本不會傷害她！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "我真的受夠了......格拉尼，可蘿爾在哪？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "可蘿爾只是想保護這個村子。她其實也不在乎寶藏。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鮑勃",
      "text": "那就把寶藏給我！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "整合運動和賞金獵人也沒什麼不同。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鮑勃",
      "text": "我跟你們賞金獵人不是一路人！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鮑勃",
      "text": "我曾經也是斯卡蒂你這樣的混蛋，但現在我全都看清楚了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鮑勃",
      "text": "眼下這個世道，什麼財富，地位，都是狗屁。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鮑勃",
      "text": "我們只想靠那筆寶藏活下去，僅此而已！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "我再說一遍，把可蘿爾給我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "無論是可蘿爾還是寶藏，我都不會交給你們。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "這可是我的委託。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鮑勃",
      "text": "格拉尼！你還有機會！我不想和你打這場對誰都沒好處的架！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鮑勃",
      "text": "我只要拿到寶藏，誰都不會吃苦頭！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "這份寶藏裡本來就有你那一份，大鮑勃！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鮑勃",
      "text": "我還有我的兄弟們！我要先見到寶藏再說！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "如果要用武力的話，我們之間的差距，你們自己心裡明白。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "雖然沒什麼自信，但如果要同時和你們開戰，我能做到。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鮑勃",
      "text": "至少我們之間的問題是可以解決的，格拉尼！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "不。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鮑勃",
      "text": "那我們就先解決她！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "說完了沒？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "如果在這裡開戰，就真的沒有回頭路可走了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鮑勃",
      "text": "我們————",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "格拉尼！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "太好了，我找到了！我找到寶藏了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可蘿爾",
      "text": "我好不容易都把整箱都拖出———",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可蘿爾",
      "text": "鮑勃先生！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可蘿爾",
      "text": "你平安無事就——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "別過來！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可蘿爾",
      "text": "欸？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "......嘖！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鮑勃",
      "text": "哈......哈......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鮑勃",
      "text": "我們......早就沒有回頭路了!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "誒？可蘿爾！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "斯卡蒂！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "你為什麼要用這種沒有威力的爆破物？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鮑勃",
      "text": "還給她的人情。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鮑勃",
      "text": "接下來，就要用真的了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "斯卡蒂。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "你不關心寶藏。而且，你也不想傷害可蘿爾小姐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "否則，在爆炸的那一瞬間，你就會出手擄走她並搶走寶藏，而不是保護她了吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "我不要寶藏。我要的答案在可蘿爾身上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "早說出來不就好了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "說實話，裝壞人也很累吧？坦率一點不好嘛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "我不想讓其他人捲進我的......任務裡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "但這次的任務目標對我而言，真的很重要。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "那當然，我知道。雖然我們任務不同，但方向是一致的不是嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "幫助其他幹員完成任務，是理所當然的吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "哼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "只能用武力來裁定寶藏的歸屬了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "斯卡蒂，下手一定要輕一點，輕一點哦！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鮑勃",
      "text": "格 拉 尼！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "鮑勃大叔，抱歉，可能會有點疼！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
